{"id":"t34059","key":"cent mille dollars au soleil|1964","csv":{"title":"Cent Mille Dollars au soleil","year":1964,"directors":["Henri Verneuil"],"rating":8,"watchedDate":"2021-09-15"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":34059,"imdbId":"tt0056917","wikidataId":"Q164770","title":"Cent Mille Dollars au soleil","originalTitle":"Cent Mille Dollars au soleil","altTitles":["100 000 $ na slunci","100 000 dolarů na slunci","Centomila dollari al sole","Codicia bajo el sol","Cien mil dólares al sol","Cent mille dollars au soleil","绝岭三雄飞车争霸战"],"tagline":"","overview":"Aux portes du désert, Castigliano dirige une entreprise de transports routiers. Hans doit conduire un chargement clandestin de cent mille dollars au cœur de l'Afrique. L'apprenant, Rocco élimine le chauffeur, vole son véhicule et part avec sa complice. Castigliano promet alors une forte récompense à Marec s'il récupère le camion. Commence une folle poursuite…","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"1964-04-17","runtime":130,"status":"Released","genres":["Action","Aventure","Comédie"],"genreIds":[28,12,35],"countries":["France","Italy"],"originCountry":["FR"],"languages":["Français"],"originalLanguage":"fr","directors":["Henri Verneuil"],"directorIds":[34580],"writers":["Michel Audiard","Marcel Jullian","Claude Veillot","Henri Verneuil"],"composers":["Georges Delerue"],"cinematographers":["Marcel Grignon"],"editors":["Claude Durand"],"producers":["Irénée Leriche","Robert Sussfeld"],"cast":[{"id":3829,"name":"Jean-Paul Belmondo","character":"Rocco","profilePath":"/hXAM7zTXGWVAv0VLGGrnxAJJbca.jpg"},{"id":15397,"name":"Lino Ventura","character":"Hervé Marec, aka 'Le plouc'","profilePath":"/curER6hJxl7c41FXmgmJHBip3uS.jpg"},{"id":24379,"name":"Bernard Blier","character":"Mitch-Mitch","profilePath":"/6xRHGb7CNDa83rcTzCp3LeIvU2s.jpg"},{"id":35884,"name":"Andréa Parisy","character":"Pepa","profilePath":"/5ogiMX0QQkhf5dioenRY6YHgXUb.jpg"},{"id":9908,"name":"Gert Fröbe","character":"Castigliano, aka 'La betterave'","profilePath":"/